    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/c0d53b2ddcc9ad11a1fccba80ad6ba11.avif?t=1704286922\" /></span><br>In the game &quot;The Police Interceptors Simulator: War Against Racers,&quot; you will be able to test yourself in various scenarios, such as chasing racers, stopping armed bandits, providing road assistance, and much more.<br>Embark on diverse missions and tasks that will present you with new challenges and difficulties. Apply all your police skills, tactics, and agility to successfully complete each mission.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/38bb138e2ead6e3a5814bbf34a6732c3.poster.avif?t=1704286922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/38bb138e2ead6e3a5814bbf34a6732c3.webm?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/38bb138e2ead6e3a5814bbf34a6732c3.mp4?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose from different police cars with unique characteristics to confront various types of racers. Hit the city streets behind the wheel of fast sports cars and reliable patrol vehicles. Each of them has its own features, such as speed, maneuverability, durability, and special technologies that will help you pursue and stop dangerous racers.<br>Earn rewards and money for successfully completed missions to upgrade and modify your cars for better performance and efficiency. This will help you fight illegal racers more effectively.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/0f7f6ceb9e0b0f492acfaba0a5ce45df.poster.avif?t=1704286922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/0f7f6ceb9e0b0f492acfaba0a5ce45df.webm?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/0f7f6ceb9e0b0f492acfaba0a5ce45df.mp4?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Confront dangerous and cunning racers with various skills and tactics who will try to avoid arrest at any cost. Criminals may use various evasion techniques to confuse and destabilize you. You will need to stay one step ahead to decipher their strategies and stop them. Prepare for unpredictable situations and tough decisions during pursuits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/b08b8697da0cf8dea589358de23bc229.poster.avif?t=1704286922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/b08b8697da0cf8dea589358de23bc229.webm?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/b08b8697da0cf8dea589358de23bc229.mp4?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in the thrilling world of street racing with enhanced graphics and sound effects. The high-quality graphics in the game will bring realism to every detail, from dynamic cars to picturesque details of the surrounding world.<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/c229e16f27aa99f2e570a11a00dc2779.poster.avif?t=1704286922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/c229e16f27aa99f2e570a11a00dc2779.webm?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/c229e16f27aa99f2e570a11a00dc2779.mp4?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Get ready for thrilling police chases and unpredictable situations in the game &quot;The Police Interceptors Simulator: War Against Racers.&quot; Download the game right now and show your skills in fighting crime on the roads!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/042f40b26a589048375394c739e9e432.avif?t=1704286922\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/c0d53b2ddcc9ad11a1fccba80ad6ba11.avif?t=1704286922\" /></span><br>In the game &quot;The Police Interceptors Simulator: War Against Racers,&quot; you will be able to test yourself in various scenarios, such as chasing racers, stopping armed bandits, providing road assistance, and much more.<br>Embark on diverse missions and tasks that will present you with new challenges and difficulties. Apply all your police skills, tactics, and agility to successfully complete each mission.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/38bb138e2ead6e3a5814bbf34a6732c3.poster.avif?t=1704286922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/38bb138e2ead6e3a5814bbf34a6732c3.webm?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/38bb138e2ead6e3a5814bbf34a6732c3.mp4?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose from different police cars with unique characteristics to confront various types of racers. Hit the city streets behind the wheel of fast sports cars and reliable patrol vehicles. Each of them has its own features, such as speed, maneuverability, durability, and special technologies that will help you pursue and stop dangerous racers.<br>Earn rewards and money for successfully completed missions to upgrade and modify your cars for better performance and efficiency. This will help you fight illegal racers more effectively.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/0f7f6ceb9e0b0f492acfaba0a5ce45df.poster.avif?t=1704286922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/0f7f6ceb9e0b0f492acfaba0a5ce45df.webm?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/0f7f6ceb9e0b0f492acfaba0a5ce45df.mp4?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Confront dangerous and cunning racers with various skills and tactics who will try to avoid arrest at any cost. Criminals may use various evasion techniques to confuse and destabilize you. You will need to stay one step ahead to decipher their strategies and stop them. Prepare for unpredictable situations and tough decisions during pursuits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/b08b8697da0cf8dea589358de23bc229.poster.avif?t=1704286922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/b08b8697da0cf8dea589358de23bc229.webm?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/b08b8697da0cf8dea589358de23bc229.mp4?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in the thrilling world of street racing with enhanced graphics and sound effects. The high-quality graphics in the game will bring realism to every detail, from dynamic cars to picturesque details of the surrounding world.<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/c229e16f27aa99f2e570a11a00dc2779.poster.avif?t=1704286922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/c229e16f27aa99f2e570a11a00dc2779.webm?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/c229e16f27aa99f2e570a11a00dc2779.mp4?t=1704286922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Get ready for thrilling police chases and unpredictable situations in the game &quot;The Police Interceptors Simulator: War Against Racers.&quot; Download the game right now and show your skills in fighting crime on the roads!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547150/extras/042f40b26a589048375394c739e9e432.avif?t=1704286922\" /></span>",
